# WH-1000XM5 Equalizer Presets on real hardware: Linux, 2026-10-18, captured
# by the frame log in the app. The protocol info matches real-attach's,
# recorded on firmware 2.5.1. Attach reads the Equalizer available, on Off
# and flat. A development build then sent EQEBB_GET_CAPABILITY for PRESET_EQ
# in English (50 00 01). The Device's EQEBB_RET_CAPABILITY advertises six
# bands of 21 steps (Clear Bass and five Bands, -10..+10) and twelve Presets
# with empty names: 00, 10..17, a0, a1, a2. Then the app picks Mellow, Vocal,
# Custom 1 and Custom 2, each as a Preset alone; the Device ACKs each and
# notifies it with its curve. Replays drop the probe with
# support::without_capability_probe.
